From bf31f8a316276b0edccb5acf5eeca9c6ffb91081 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Justin <justurn@live.com>
Date: Tue, 20 Oct 2026 13:02:57 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] fix: map_extractor segfault on Cata split root ADTs (I-417)

adt_MHDR::getMCIN() returned a pointer even when offsMCIN is 0. The
LostIsles split root ADTs in PATCH-T have no MCIN, so ConvertADT read
garbage MCNK offsets and segfaulted at map 648, aborting the whole
extraction. Return nullptr like getMH2O/getMFBO; ConvertADT already
skips a tile without cells.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01UBPV6ZJQU8VTjnHQQesNg4
---
 src/tools/map_extractor/adt.h | 5 ++++-
 1 file changed, 4 insertions(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/src/tools/map_extractor/adt.h b/src/tools/map_extractor/adt.h
index 4cbbb20a0..dafef5946 100644
--- a/src/tools/map_extractor/adt.h
+++ b/src/tools/map_extractor/adt.h
@@ -376,7 +376,10 @@ public:
     bool prepareLoadedData();
     adt_MCIN* getMCIN()
     {
-        return reinterpret_cast<adt_MCIN*>(reinterpret_cast<uint8*>(&flags) + offsMCIN);
+        // Cata split root ADTs (zep-lost-isles-terrain) have no MCIN (I-417)
+        if (offsMCIN)
+            return reinterpret_cast<adt_MCIN*>(reinterpret_cast<uint8*>(&flags) + offsMCIN);
+        return nullptr;
     }
     adt_MH2O* getMH2O()
     {
-- 
